    "reason": "Blood Tribute's Spirit Resist is a minor side stat, but it is a popular, recognizable item whose resist is listed as a plain stat. Echo Shard's Spirit Resist 5 is also a throwaway stat on an item known only for resetting cooldowns. Echo Shard is equally or more obscure here, so a 100 vs 85 split is not justified.",
