    "claim": "should_be_more_obscure",
    "reason": "Spellbreaker is a name players associate with anti-spirit defense, but it is a 6400 item, so fewer players buy it than the cheaper Tier 3 Spirit Resilience. Still, placing it at 30 alongside Witchmail and Enchanter's Emblem is plausible. Dispel Magic is bought often, and its Spirit Resist is a minor stat. The two should not be so far apart; Spellbreaker is at least as likely to be named for anti-spirit reasons.",
